   "props": {
    "h1Text": [
     "Outdoor Playground Equipment Manufacturer & Supplier in Delhi & Uttar Pradesh"
    ],
    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "fs-18 lh-30 mt-15px",
      "pText": "Delhi and Uttar Pradesh see some of the widest swings in weather anywhere in India, from scorching May afternoons to foggy January mornings. FunPlay Systems designs and manufactures outdoor playground equipment for housing societies, schools, parks, institutions and townships across this region. Everything is made at our factory in Vasai East, Maharashtra, and sent north by road for installation by our team or a dealer in the north. The same warranty applies here as anywhere else in India."
     },
     {
      "pClass": "fs-18 lh-30 mt-15px",
      "pText": "Buyers here vary a great deal. High-rise societies in Noida, Greater Noida and Ghaziabad want compact play areas for podiums and central lawns. Schools in Delhi, Lucknow, Kanpur and Agra want equipment that takes a full school day of use, while development authorities and municipal bodies need park equipment that can handle evening crowds. We plan each one from your site size, the age group and photos, and send a layout drawing with the safe play area marked."
     },
     {
      "pText": "Discover top playground equipment manufacturers in Delhi, specializing in high-quality play solutions for parks and recreational areas. Here you can get details about our offerings."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "CityExploreMoreCategories",
   "props": {
    "h2Class": "h4 text-white fw-600",
    "h2Text": "How would you like to start?",
    "pText": "Turn your playground dreams to reality"
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "CityWhyChooseUs",
   "props": {
    "divText": [
     {
      "tag": "span",
      "attrs": {
       "className": "fs-24 alt-font text-dark-gray d-block fw-600 ls-minus-1px mb-0"
      },
      "c": [
       "Designer, Manufacturer of Outdoor Play Equipment"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "CityDiv",
   "props": {
    "items": [
     {
      "richText": {
       "heading": "Heat, dust and winter fog",
       "className": "pt-0 pb-50px",
       "content": [
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "c": [
          "Summer in the plains brings very hot afternoons and dusty winds, so place slides and decks where buildings or trees shade them after midday. Lighter shades from our 15+ roto-moulded colours stay cooler than dark ones. Dust settles quickly in the dry months, and a wash before the evening rush keeps the equipment clean."
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "c": [
          "Winter brings the opposite problem. Dense fog leaves decks and steps damp for much of the morning, and the ground stays cold and wet. Rubber flooring on a well-drained base helps through both seasons and through the monsoon from late June to September. Galvanised steel and roto-moulded plastic do not rust, which matters when equipment stays wet for weeks."
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "richText": {
       "heading": "From NCR towers to towns across Uttar Pradesh",
       "className": "pt-0 pb-50px",
       "content": [
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "c": [
          "Societies in the National Capital Region often build play areas on a podium above the parking, where we use a self-standing installation that leaves the waterproofing untouched. See our pages for ",
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "href": "/outdoor-playground-equipment-manufacturer-in-noida.html"
           },
           "c": [
            "Noida"
           ]
          },
          " and ",
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "href": "/outdoor-playground-equipment-manufacturer-in-ghaziabad.html"
           },
           "c": [
            "Ghaziabad"
           ]
          },
          ". In Lucknow, Kanpur, Varanasi and smaller district towns, more sites are open ground, so grouting the posts is usually the better choice."
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "c": [
          "Large public parks and school grounds benefit from structures that many children can share, such as our ",
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "href": "/corecraft/play-lands.html"
           },
           "c": [
            "Play Lands multi play stations"
           ]
          },
          ". Smaller colony parks can start with individual pieces and add more later. For the state capital, our ",
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "href": "/outdoor-playground-equipment-manufacturer-in-lucknow.html"
           },
           "c": [
            "Lucknow page"
           ]
          },
          " has more detail."
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "cityFacts": {
     "heading": "FunPlay in Delhi & Uttar Pradesh",
     "facts": [
