       "value": "By road from Vasai; installed by our team or a local dealer"
      },
      {
       "label": "Sales enquiries",
       "value": "+91 902 830 2266 · sales@funplaysystems.com",
       "href": "tel:+919028302266"
      }
     ]
    },
    "faq": {
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Do you supply playground equipment in Delhi and across Uttar Pradesh?",
       "a": "Yes. We manufacture at our Vasai factory and send equipment by road to Delhi, the NCR and towns across Uttar Pradesh. Installation is done by our own team or a dealer in the north."
      },
      {
       "q": "Can play equipment go on a society podium in Noida or Ghaziabad?",
       "a": "Yes. We install it self-standing, so the slab does not need deep drilling. Share the slab details and photos early so your structural consultant can confirm the load before we finalise the layout."
      },
      {
       "q": "How do we keep a playground usable through a north Indian summer?",
       "a": "Shade is the main step. Place slides and decks where buildings or trees cover them in the afternoon, choose lighter colours and add a gazebo or pergola from our garden decor range for waiting parents."
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you plan equipment for a large public park?",
       "a": "Yes. Share the park plan, the areas set aside for play and the age groups expected. We suggest equipment, mark the safe play areas on a layout drawing and quote for manufacture, dispatch and installation."
      }
     ],
     "id": "city-faq"
    }
   }
